import{_ as t,o as n,c as i,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 657 | Time Domain and Transcendence | Contrasting the Predatory-Faction Transcendent Ones' Time Waste","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 657 | Time Domain and Transcendence | Contrasting the Predatory-Faction Transcendent Ones' Time Waste","no":657,"module":3,"tags":["Time Domain","Predatory Faction","Time Waste","Transcendent-One Comparison","Anti-Predation"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise","57-Dark-Substitution Body Origin and Essence","608-Predatory-Faction Generic Time Zero-Sum Game"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0657_模块3-时间域与超脱-对比掠夺派超脱者的时间浪费.md","filePath":"en/0657_模块3-时间域与超脱-对比掠夺派超脱者的时间浪费.md"}`),o={name:"en/0657_模块3-时间域与超脱-对比掠夺派超脱者的时间浪费.md"};function s(r,e,l,c,d,h){return n(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-657-time-domain-and-transcendence-contrasting-the-predatory-faction-transcendent-ones-time-waste" tabindex="-1">Entry 657 | Time Domain and Transcendence | Contrasting the Predatory-Faction Transcendent Ones&#39; Time Waste <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-657-time-domain-and-transcendence-contrasting-the-predatory-faction-transcendent-ones-time-waste" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 657 | Time Domain and Transcendence | Contrasting the Predatory-Faction Transcendent Ones&#39; Time Waste&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 57, Entry 608 | Series: Time Domain and Transcendence (Entry 4)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-strongest-ones-waste-the-most-time" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the strongest ones waste the most time <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-strongest-ones-waste-the-most-time" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the strongest ones waste the most time&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The most ironic phenomenon in predatory-faction systems is: <strong>those with the most time waste the most time</strong>. A Great Emperor who lived ten thousand years slept for nine thousand of them; an Immortal Emperor who lived a hundred thousand years wandered for ninety-nine thousand of them. These strong ones&#39; time resources — their energy consumption, their cosmic-space occupation, the ecological cost of maintaining their own existence — are all wasted.</p><p>Six top-level axioms here become analytical tools: anti-predation axiom requires examining the predatory essence of this time waste; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires asking whose interests the wasted time could have served; collective ascension axiom requires comparing the symbiotic faction&#39;s alternatives; causal self-discipline axiom requires tracking the causal consequences of time waste; law-first axiom requires analyzing at the law level why predatory-faction systems necessarily produce time waste. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. This entry systematically contrasts the predatory-faction transcendent ones&#39; time waste.</p><h2 id="i-four-forms-of-predatory-faction-transcendent-ones-time-waste" tabindex="-1">I. Four Forms of Predatory-Faction Transcendent Ones&#39; Time Waste <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-four-forms-of-predatory-faction-transcendent-ones-time-waste" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Four Forms of Predatory-Faction Transcendent Ones&#39; Time Waste&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_1-1-form-1-sleep-waste" tabindex="-1">1.1 Form 1: Sleep Waste <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-1-form-1-sleep-waste" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.1 Form 1: Sleep Waste&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The most common form of time waste: the strong one enters long sleep after reaching the peak. Older-generation Great Emperors in Shrouding routinely sleep for tens of thousands of years. The cosmic energy consumed during these sleeps, the cultivation resources occupied, the civilizational-development opportunities delayed — all are net waste. A sleeping strong one contributes nothing to civilization, but the resources he needs to maintain his own existence never stop consuming.</p><h3 id="_1-2-form-2-wandering-waste" tabindex="-1">1.2 Form 2: Wandering Waste <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-2-form-2-wandering-waste" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.2 Form 2: Wandering Waste&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The second form: the strong one does not sleep, but wanders aimlessly in the universe. In Dragon Ball, Goku&#39;s daily life in the peace era after defeating Buu is training and strolling. Training itself is not bad, but when training has no civilizational goal, no output backflow, no Myriad-Rank sharing, it is a personal time self-cycle — producing no civilizational increment.</p><h3 id="_1-3-form-3-maintenance-waste" tabindex="-1">1.3 Form 3: Maintenance Waste <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-3-form-3-maintenance-waste" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.3 Form 3: Maintenance Waste&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The third form: after occupying the highest position, the strong one&#39;s main energy goes to &quot;holding the position&quot; — guarding against latecomers challenging, maintaining existing order, suppressing potential threats. This maintenance consumes the strong one&#39;s enormous time, but this time investment produces no civilizational increment — it only maintains the strong one&#39;s own monopolistic position.</p><h3 id="_1-4-form-4-nihilistic-waste" tabindex="-1">1.4 Form 4: Nihilistic Waste <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-4-form-4-nihilistic-waste" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.4 Form 4: Nihilistic Waste&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The deepest waste: after the strong one lives long enough, he finds everything meaningless. Time passing in this nihilistic state is the most thorough waste — not only no output, but consuming the strong one&#39;s spiritual energy to maintain the middle state of &quot;not wanting to die and not wanting to live.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-magnitude-estimate-of-time-waste" tabindex="-1">II. Magnitude Estimate of Time Waste <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-magnitude-estimate-of-time-waste" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Magnitude Estimate of Time Waste&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Waste Form</th><th>Single Waste Time</th><th>Corresponding Civilizational Opportunity Cost</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Great Emperor Sleeping</td><td>~10,000–50,000 years</td><td>Time in which civilization could complete multiple technology upgrades</td></tr><tr><td>Strong One Wandering</td><td>~1,000–10,000 years</td><td>Time in which civilization could raise generations of cultivators</td></tr><tr><td>Maintenance Consumption</td><td>Ongoing</td><td>All the time civilizational development is suppressed</td></tr><tr><td>Nihilistic State</td><td>Uncertain (possibly extremely long)</td><td>Time in which civilizational-spiritual resources are corrupted</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The sum of these time wastes constitutes predatory-faction systems&#39; greatest hidden cost — <strong>Myriad Ranks paid time resources, but received no civilizational return</strong>.</p><p>As a contrasting anchor, Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Origin Acceleration Domain converts the transcendent one&#39;s time investment into hundredfold-iterated civilizational increments; the Quest Sediment Domain converts the transcendent one&#39;s sedimentation time into spiritual resources shared by Myriad Ranks; the Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision records the transcendent one&#39;s time use throughout, ensuring zero waste; and the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&#39;s eternally-running construction system fundamentally negates the &quot;post-peak AFK&quot; time waste. The law-first axiom requires: the transcendent one&#39;s time allocation must serve Myriad Ranks; the &quot;alive but not building&quot; state may not be allowed to persist.</p><h2 id="iii-the-predatory-essence-of-time-waste" tabindex="-1">III. The Predatory Essence of Time Waste <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-predatory-essence-of-time-waste" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Predatory Essence of Time Waste&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Time waste is not a &quot;personal choice&quot; — it is essentially predation:</p><ul><li>The energy consumed by a sleeping strong one comes from the environment Myriad Ranks survive in;</li><li>The cultivation resources occupied by a wandering strong one could have been used to raise the new generation;</li><li>The development possibilities civilization itself suppresses by a maintenance strong one;</li><li>The confidence Myriad Ranks have in life&#39;s meaning corrupted by a nihilistic strong one.</li></ul><p>Every form of time waste is a covert predation by the strong of Myriad Ranks&#39; time resources — he takes the time Myriad Ranks could have used, then uses it to &quot;do nothing.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-heng-yuan-zhou-s-alternative-review" tabindex="-1">IV. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Alternative (Review) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-heng-yuan-zhou-s-alternative-review" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Alternative (Review)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In contrast with predatory-faction time waste, Heng Yuan Zhou transcendent ones&#39; eternally-running construction (Entry 656) invests all the transcendent one&#39;s time in constructive directions: civilizational-ascension deduction, infrastructure maintenance, Myriad-Rank cultivation guidance, cross-plane coordination, self-sedimentation. Same transcendent one, same long lifespan — the predatory-faction version sleeps; the symbiotic-faction version builds. <strong>The difference is not in ability, but in the philosophy of time allocation</strong>.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: this entry&#39;s core — systematically revealing the predatory-faction transcendent ones&#39; four time-waste forms and their magnitudes, proving this is civilization&#39;s greatest hidden energy-level waste</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: time waste&#39;s essence is predation — the strong takes Myriad Ranks&#39; time resources then does nothing; this is the most covert and most wasteful predation</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: explicitly named comparison — Tang-Luo-style transcendent ones have nothing to do after the peak, all time wasted; Heng Yuan Zhou transcendent ones&#39; eternally-running construction converts all time into civilizational increments</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: time waste&#39;s victims are all beings of Myriad Ranks — every bit of energy consumed by a sleeping strong one is a resource Myriad Ranks could have used</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the analytical method for predatory-faction time waste and the alternative scheme are all public; Quest-Domain simulation debrief may be used to educate later beings to avoid this waste; the anti-waste mechanism leading to the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm may infinitely expand</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The most absurd fact about predatory-faction systems is: the strongest ones waste the most time. Sleeping, wandering, maintaining, nihilism — four time-waste forms stacked constitute predatory-faction civilization&#39;s greatest hidden cost. These wastes are not &quot;the strong one&#39;s freedom,&quot; but covert predation of Myriad Ranks&#39; time resources. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s dual-track time-domain system precisely provides an alternative: the same transcendent one, in eternally-running construction converts every bit of time into a civilizational increment. <strong>Not wasting time is the transcendent one&#39;s most basic responsibility to Myriad Ranks</strong>.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/57-黑暗置换体起源与本质.html">Entry 57 · Dark-Substitution Body Origin and Essence</a> · <a href="./608_模块3-双轨时间域vs掠夺派通用-时间零和博弈.html">Entry 608 · Predatory-Faction Generic Time Zero-Sum Game</a> · <a href="./658_模块3-时间域与超脱-时间域作为超脱者反哺万族的工具.html">Entry 658 · The Time Domain as the Transcendent One&#39;s Tool for Giving Back to Myriad Ranks</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const g=t(o,[["render",s]]);export{u as __pageData,g as default};
